     no local structural extension needs no synthetic wrapper: the
     restriction on BaseType targets opcua:DriveType directly. SubType has no
     own definer node (pure inheritance) and gets no new axioms whatsoever:
     it relies entirely on rdfs:subClassOf BaseType (proven through the real
     nodeset2owl.py pipeline, not just the unit tests). -->
